{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "5a025aa413db6fdfbfa09a89fb84efef5c4681f11c2227c2cf82e66fa1853f54", "ja": "計画", "zh": "计划", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "1b37c53866cf2192b86f260e2607e204072fec41daf0a8841630d7caf6601cde", "ja": "圧倒的な武力で基地を制圧したネメシスは\n次の計画を進める。一方、両親の仇である\n『黒髪』が現れたと聞き激昂するジュリア。\nそして司令室で密談するシャドウレディーと\nザ・ファースト。ネメシス総帥とは…。", "zh": "Nemesis以压倒性武力镇压基地后，\n决定将计划推进至下一阶段。另一方面，\n茱莉亚听闻杀害双亲的仇人『黑发』现身后，\n不禁怒火中烧。而影子淑女和The First也在\n司令室展开密谈。Nemesis总帅究竟是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_03_1001_006mak", "source_sha256": "53f843b21289793e0713b43a5ca6bcc1e0a636e3b10ebe24c642d2c82251f715", "ja": "カオリ。たった今、極東軍の宇宙基地、全施設の\n制圧が完了したよ。戦闘員達も全員、配置に就いた。", "zh": "歌织，远东军太空基地的所有设施\n已在方才镇压完毕，战斗人员也都就位了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_03_1002_052kao", "source_sha256": "fe7961475478da36c308f8292ebeca3e32710440574780658218eb6e0e4334a0", "ja": "そうか。ではシホの部隊に、\n『デストルジャベリン』の搬入を急がせよう。", "zh": "这样啊，那么传令给志保的部队，\n要她们加快搬运『死欲标枪』。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_03_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "406c3b97cfac99f946058b113f40374c11dda0d2cf13d4d93b84377db1d00af4", "ja": "ねぇ。君はシホを気に入っているのかい？\nずいぶんと自由にさせてるようだけど。", "zh": "欸，你很中意志保吗？\n看你好像挺放任她的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_03_1004_052kao", "source_sha256": "08a42136dbeeead6100628650aa1b1be31f0f0e9bb89c8e7508e0a3de825f50b", "ja": "そう見えるのか？", "zh": "你这么觉得吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_03_1005_006mak", "source_sha256": "c4b5af3b6544c3f36e9fe9f573c8d9b137ed07917902a52390094ac8591cf12e", "ja": "いや、そうでもなかった。……ああそう、さっき\nヒーローズのスパイを見つけたよ。逃げられたけど。", "zh": "不，倒也没有……啊对了，在下刚才\n找到了英雄联盟的间谍，但被跑掉了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_03_1006_006mak", "source_sha256": "ffbd338cb1010db8b287bcc6771849efdfbcd834948c8c14eb73c1d950927597", "ja": "ヒーローズなんて小物ばかりだと思ってたけど、\n中には、面白い連中もいるのかもしれないね。", "zh": "在下还以为英雄联盟都是些小角色，\n看来里面或许有几个人挺有意思的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_03_1007_006mak", "source_sha256": "7fda33675c629d65313fe6f2243eda580a0c1b1656d62961ee3dc1b0c1a06fdd", "ja": "たとえば、そう……\n君の、この外側みたいな。ね？", "zh": "比方说……\n你现在这副外壳，是吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_03_1008_052kao", "source_sha256": "d324c91b59c9c5029e1770bb6ac4c432b0a6835c742640d78ddec2cad592c30b", "ja": "くだらない事を。\nこの体は、私にとって都合のいい入れ物にすぎない。", "zh": "无聊，这具躯体对我而言\n不过是方便的容器罢了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_03_1009_006mak", "source_sha256": "c48eb5c9be5f1c74ca8e2dba2744c4c0cdec0c8e677770a41fd05ed9a440c8ef", "ja": "うん、そうだね。\n……大事なのは外側じゃない。君自身、その魂だ。", "zh": "嗯，说得也是。\n……重要的不是外壳，而是你自己的灵魂。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_03_1010_052kao", "source_sha256": "0ce6ed4d8bf5bc8e0e7a4a6bb81340825d445a7c111f75520c78c2f13878e4fd", "ja": "ヒーローズ。正義などという欺瞞に凝り固まった\n連中には、思い出させてやらねばならない。", "zh": "英雄联盟……我们一定要让那些\n满嘴正义的伪君子回想起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_03_1011_052kao", "source_sha256": "1ee107e083dc9e4a9890f9117cdeab77338b1e87ccb8efc69d6b846fc42891bb", "ja": "この世界に於いて、真実はただひとつ。圧倒的なまでの\n力、暴力。そして、力によって支配される世界だ。", "zh": "这个世界只有一种真理，就是压倒性的力量──\n暴力，以及被暴力支配的世界。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_03_1012_006mak", "source_sha256": "e618f522966b57b5d4285c51e14c48df62038138c081ff34338e411403da5256", "ja": "ならボクは今度こそ、あの日の誓いを果たそう。\nいつかこの世界が滅びるまで、君と共に在り続けると。", "zh": "那在下这次一定会实现当时的誓言。\n直到世界毁灭那天，在下都将与你同在。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_03_1013_006mak", "source_sha256": "7730e50061d0311178337515e704b0a92171540bd7aa7b4a03d89fdcf563f200", "ja": "この世界が、君の望む形で在るために。\nボクがこの世界を、永遠の闇に染めてみせよう。", "zh": "为了将这个世界变成你所期望的样貌，\n就让在下用永恒的黑暗为这世界上色吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_03_1015_023aka", "source_sha256": "ed286abfa15865c0d78a61f44f3f4ef19e6c3f3a42c399c44ddc4a0c85388d2f", "ja": "つむりん、お疲れさま～！　いやぁ、\nつむりんも招集されてるとは思わなかったニャー。", "zh": "䌷䌷，辛苦了～！哎呀，\n没想到䌷䌷也会收到召集命令喵～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_03_1016_051tmg", "source_sha256": "41263e2a70a883a8be3911c47e2e8747a356230a6104ec8829c9d26c6f45651e", "ja": "茜、体はもういいのですか？　まさか極東基地で、あの\n『黒髪』と交戦するとは……本当に、無事でよかった。", "zh": "茜，你已经不要紧了吗？没想到你竟然在远东基地\n跟『黑发』交战……现在看你平安无事，真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_03_1017_023aka", "source_sha256": "99dcc802505214adabb0275e206dd9e8686a072008b006ae0689b5e5dbdb4c93", "ja": "いや～、さすがにもうダメかなって思ったけどね！\nピンチの時こそ輝く！　これぞ、茜ちゃんだよね！", "zh": "哎呀～小茜当时也觉得自己没救了！\n但越是危急就越厉害！这才是小茜嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_03_1018_050jul", "source_sha256": "2ad9db87e6baaa3b6335621097de9d94bf7fe2609edeb3bb3227ec143b346b0c", "ja": "おいっ、アカネ！\nさっき本部にしてた報告は、本当なのか！？", "zh": "喂，茜！\n你刚才给总部的报告，是真的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_03_1019_023aka", "source_sha256": "3b9b5ec6f7ae7742b99bcc1276d8fca0b0548d35afd995fe94e3f948d5fa8b16", "ja": "ひゃぁっ、ジュリアン！？\nえっと、あの、その……聞いちゃったの？", "zh": "哇啊！茱莉安！？\n呃，那个、这个……你听到了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_03_1020_050jul", "source_sha256": "3b4f97b0cae6b10bae8333a282ebb9392cc8fc1c920f19b0f490cfd18b5c2268", "ja": "じゃあ本当なんだな、『黒髪』が現れたってのは！\nあいつは……あいつだけは、許さない。", "zh": "所以是真的，『黑发』真的出现了！\n那家伙……我绝对不会放过那家伙的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_03_1021_050jul", "source_sha256": "c84d204a3da37a1feacf503c220c2d6fd383b57f7243f85ed102e7ea9465d34d", "ja": "あたしも極東に行く！\n待ってろよ、『黒髪』……必ず、両親の仇を……！", "zh": "我也要去远东！\n给我等着，『黑发』……我一定要替父母报仇……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_03_1022_023aka", "source_sha256": "e4594ac55c56be800160f2af63f1ba8b512ffcf9987b192b734e79482eae6602", "ja": "待って待って、ジュリアン！　いきなり乗り込むのは\n危なすぎるって！　やめようよ、ね？　ね？", "zh": "等一下啊，茱莉安！你这样突然杀过去，\n实在太危险了！还是别去了，好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_03_1023_051tmg", "source_sha256": "59c681573cffcf39c13659af209241656c344995da50d246219dbd50823a724b", "ja": "そうですジュリア、ザ・ファーストも言っていました。\n敵の正体がわかるまで、我々は待機だと……。", "zh": "是啊，茱莉亚，The First也说了，\n在掌握敌人身分前，要我们待命……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_03_1024_050jul", "source_sha256": "5006442faa2ed0dc9535da35195a346666eccb1dbe93760535143b81fab1ed94", "ja": "けど、ふたりとも知ってるだろ？\nあたしの両親は、あいつに殺されたんだ。", "zh": "可是，你们也知道不是吗？\n我的父母就是死在她手上。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_03_1025_050jul", "source_sha256": "7d2756623196451bdbd0572ed8eb2ff7fd3012fe35bff0dc4c9238273393740d", "ja": "ヒーローズ研究所は焼き尽くされて、\nあたしに残されたのは、このアミュレットだけ……。", "zh": "英雄联盟研究所付之一炬，\n我唯一剩下的，就只有这个护身符……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_03_1026_051tmg", "source_sha256": "98b7e3ed3432d5db0d632484b60babd3f79a0e6ed9f704205a78209306e4ca4d", "ja": "ジュリア……。", "zh": "茱莉亚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_03_1027_023aka", "source_sha256": "91693a91728592db2b405d4e8aa588c2e60f094f521f2184104a0714716142a1", "ja": "ジュリアン……。", "zh": "茱莉安……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_03_1028_050jul", "source_sha256": "b2d03ed043399956379f69ca7ec4b4ae5d2ef5b61b74e6a4759c149e51380861", "ja": "なぁ、あたしの気持ち、ムギならわかってくれるだろ？\nお前だって、たったひとりの姉さんを……！", "zh": "䌷，你一定能明白我的心情吧？\n你唯一的姊姊也是因为她……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_03_1029_051tmg", "source_sha256": "a351f775b34410907e94402da7a38308aaa3c6d1965a29a11d8707d2bc9bfcbc", "ja": "っ！", "zh": "……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_03_1030_050jul", "source_sha256": "975eff9c3e25d157a8abc10a91df5dc3bdbf13acce568523cdcad2542f3a5ed5", "ja": "あ……ゴメン、ムギ。\nアタシ、ついアツくなっちまって……。", "zh": "啊……抱歉，䌷。\n我激动过头了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_03_1032_010azu", "source_sha256": "7c09a7839ee63bd22e9f7e11e8c233a46f31a89c4e11878b826ae0d5ba033e2d", "ja": "極東基地に運び込まれたのは、デストルドーの\n衛星軌道兵器『デストルジャベリン』……。", "zh": "敌人送进远东基地的东西，\n是死欲的卫星轨道兵器『死欲标枪』……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_03_1033_010azu", "source_sha256": "f22fb659138e69b01ae0cc39409762db24ebbd175806bc47b60d11d6cb98a508", "ja": "衛星からの攻撃は、何としても阻止しなければなりま\nせん。ありがとうシャドウレディー。有益な情報です。", "zh": "我们一定要阻止来自卫星的攻击才行。\n感谢你，影子淑女，这个情报非常重要。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_03_1034_008tak", "source_sha256": "d576e83569fd4fe8c45cccf05eb3b34d92b309246dcde79034749b3af2153c66", "ja": "いえ。見習いキャットのおかげで、命拾いしました。\n次世代の成長というのは、うれしいものですね。", "zh": "不，小女子这次是托见习猫咪的福才捡回一条命。\n可以看到下个世代的成长，小女子相当开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_03_1035_008tak", "source_sha256": "ba7ff4ebea3ff5eeb2af032b2ab6250760403816dad38b149167c0bcc0400759", "ja": "それよりも、ザ・ファースト。特務機関ネメシスの、\nリーダーについてなのですが……。", "zh": "The First，更重要的是，\n关于特务机构Nemesis的首脑……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
